  "definition": "Conditions of Allocations to Institutions",
  "effectiveDate": "2021-12-10",
  "historyNote": "#8623, eff 5-4-06, EXPIRED: 5-4-14 New. #11099, eff 5-17-16; ss by #13302, eff 12-10-21",
